T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: TIDE 2.0 SCHEME \(TECHNOLOGY INCUBATION AND DEVELOPMENT OF ENTREPRENEURS\) \(TIDE 2.0\) / MEITY / EMPANELLED INCUBATORS \(IITS, IIMS, NITS\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Supports ICT and emerging technology startups \(IoT, AI, Blockchain,) Tj
T*
(Robotics\) through 51 specialized incubation centers with Entrepreneur-in-) Tj
T*
(Residence \(EiR\) and prototype grants.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Aspiring tech entrepreneurs or early-stage startups working on emerging) Tj
T*
(   technology solutions \(AI, IoT, Blockchain, CleanTech\).) Tj
T*
(2. Applicant must be incubated or willing to incubate at a recognized TIDE) Tj
T*
(   2.0 incubation center.) Tj
T*
(3. Focus on solving societal challenges in healthcare, education,) Tj
T*
(   agriculture, or financial inclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Grant support: Up to Rs. 7 Lakh for Entrepreneur-in-Residence \(EiR\)) Tj
T*
(   fellows, and up to Rs. 40 Lakh Grant/Equity for Proof of Concept &) Tj
T*
(   commercialization.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 40.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Technical proposal and architecture document) Tj
T*
(2. Founder CVs and academic credentials) Tj
T*
(3. Entity registration \(if incorporated\) or identity proofs) Tj
T*
(4. Incubator recommendation letter) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online through TIDE 2.0 partner incubation centers) Tj
T*
